%% 直接报名：提交即通过（含事件发布与通知）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as 学生
    participant W as Web路由
    participant RS as RegistrationService
    participant P as DirectRegistrationPolicy
    participant CR as CapacityRule
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant EB as EventBus
    participant NS as NotificationService

    S->>W: POST /activities/1/register
    W->>RS: register(activity_id=1, student)
    RS->>DB: 查询活动、有效报名
    alt 活动已开始或已下架
        RS-->>W: ActivityClosedError（页面提示）
    else 已有待审核/已通过/候补中的报名
        RS-->>W: DuplicateRegistrationError
    else 可提交
        RS->>P: submit(SubmissionContext)
        P->>CR: ensure_available(activity, regs)
        CR-->>P: 名额 11/120（未满）
        P-->>RS: PolicyDecision(status=approved)
        RS->>DB: BEGIN → INSERT registration → COMMIT
        RS->>EB: publish(RegistrationSubmitted)
        EB->>NS: handle(event)
        NS->>DB: INSERT notifications(inapp/email)<br/>唯一索引(event_key,channel)去重
        NS-->>S: 站内消息「报名成功」
    end
